window.products.push({"id":762112,"name":"FLEXTAILGEAR Electric Air Pump MP2Plus Ultralight Portable Air Pump Rechargeable Small Battery Air Mattress inflator with Camping Lantern for Sleeping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aFKGuGeJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶【2 Levels Quick In/Deflation】- With 4.5kPa(300L/MIN) high and 2.5kPa(192L/MIN) low pressure mode, Flextailgear MP2Plus electric air pump can well balance the speed of inflation and battery life. When choosing low-pressure mode, the battery life of our air pump can be up to 1.5 hours; high-pressure mode is 45 mins. This upgrade greatly exceeds previous or other mini pumps. Note: Double click to open the pump and one click to switch the Low/High-pressure mode. ▶【Multiple functions in one】- The newly upgraded travel air pump has stepless brightness adjustment, outdoor emergency charging, and IP44 water-resistant. Stepless camping light function allows you to find the brightness that best suits your environment (double click to open the light, long press to stepless adjust). The MP2Plus backpacking air pump also comes with emergency charging function, it can be used as an outdoor power bank to fill your phone 1-2 times (depends on the battery capacity). ▶【Extra-large rechargeable battery】- Our battery air pump has built-in 4800mAh rechargeable battery, works up to 1.5 hours during Low-Pressure Mode (45 mins on High-Pressure Mode) after fully charged. Camping lantern can work for 90 hours at 50 lumens, 16 hours at 500 lumens. The Type-C charging port can be used to charge the ultralight air pump in various ways, such as power bank, laptop, car charger, or power adapter. ▶【Portable & Design Upgrade】- The size of Flextailgear handheld camping air pump is 3.5\"*2.2\"*1.9\", weights only 6.7oz. Compared with others, our sleeping pad pump better balances size, battery life and inflation pressure. In addition, with the help of ip44 water-resistant, we have richer usage enviroment for outdoor camping, hiking, sleeping pads, air boats, kayaks, air mattress, beach toys, inflatable furniture, swimming rings and better product life. ▶【5 Nozzles Included & Warm Tips】- Come with 5 nozzles, our battery powered air pump is suitable for most small-large sized inflatable products. Please do not use continuously for more than 15 minutes, MP2PLUS doesn't suitable for balloons, car tires, bicycle tires, football or basketball. If you have any questions about our products or during use please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aFKGuGeJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLEXTAILGEAR","source_asin":"B09XXDPVMV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XXDPVMV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XXDPVMV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":762113,"name":"YTENTE Zodiac Sign Candles, Zodiac Crystal Sign Candles,Astrology Scented Candles Best Friends Gifts for Women, Men Sister Brother Zodiac Funny Birthd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F5DOCAmnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DETENTE Crystal Candle Spiritual Gift for Friends: February Birthday Candle with beautiful Aquarius Gift Box , a great gift to mother dad friends sister brother whose zodiac sign is Aquarius.Pls Note stones inside the candle could be different from the picture. Unique Healing Crystals & Stones Candles: This calming candle combines the healing power of Amethyst with the relaxing benefits of lavender essential oil. Decorated with Amethyst, package include 2 Special Zodiac sign and bead + charm pendant, very beautiful gift for women men. 100% Eco-friendly Soy Wax Candle Jar : Each candles is lovingly hand poured in small batches by us using 100% eco-friendly soy wax,Soy wax has been proven to burn slower and longer, it is natural and non toxic and has a much cleaner burn compared to other waxes out there. Aromatherapy Zodiac Sign Candles： These candles brings peace, joy and healing energies. Lavender is often associated with love, as well as for workings to bring calmness and peace. Burning a lavender scent during meditation can help you to relax, open your mind, and free yourself. These candles make the perfect gift for a loved one or a beautiful addition to your cosy living space.Any questions then please just ask!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F5DOCAmnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YTENTE","source_asin":"B09H2TCWGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H2TCWGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H2TCWGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":762114,"name":"Bucket Stormtroopers Get Schooled Fishing Parody 12 Inches x 16 Inches Reproduction Gallery Wrapped Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p4XJlUGGL._AC_.jpg","description":"WHO IS BUCKET? Bucket arrived on our planet thousands of years ago, from a race of other dimensional beings made of light, magic,nerdy science fiction, and gluten. Since protruding into our dimension, Bucket has educated the greatest artists of the world about capturing the beauty of humanity in art. Bucket has had a direct influence on our exploration of art. Bucket has decided to focus on highlighting humanity's stupidity and hilarity, because, well after all this time, Bucket finds humanity to be stupid and hilarious. Not being human, Bucket has no gender, but prefers to be identified with females as \"the only ones on your planet who seem to know what the hell they're doing.\" In her own dimension, Bucket's body is a beautiful form of starlight and cosmic magnificence, but in our dimension she manifests as a small pink lump of some rubbery stuff with eyeballs.Bucket's name in her own world is unpronounceable in any human tongue, but roughly translates as \"cylindrical vessel of light and knowledge, also convenient way to carry stuff with a terribly uncomfortable handle\". She enjoys long walks on the beach and has a strange affinity for nerdy science fiction movies and glutenous pastry products.We thank Bucket for her other-worldly artistic gifts, and hope she one day shows us how to actually recycle properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p4XJlUGGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bucket","source_asin":"B07VGKSM9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VGKSM9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VGKSM9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
