window.products.push({"id":762250,"name":"FIFO Squeeze Bottle, 16-Ounce, Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ggjL-UhVL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Do you break the tips off of our current squeeze bottle when you try to get the product to the \"top\".Do you feel like you end up throwing away product because it ends up sticking to the walls of the bottle These are common situations to find yourself in and we have the solution. The FIFO bottle. By taking advantage of gravity, these first in, first out (FIFO) bottles help minimize sauce waste. This revolutionary concept helps ensure that product is always ready to dispense. The FIFO bottle is filled from the top and dispenses from a non-drip silicone valve through the bottom. These bottle are durable and easily washable. FIFO bottles ship to you with a multipurpose dispensing valve and a white label cap. NSF Approved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ggjL-UhVL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIFO","source_asin":"B007RKS3AA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007RKS3AA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007RKS3AA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
