window.products.push({"id":762293,"name":"xooxfans 20\"x 67\" Couch Supports for Sagging Cushions Sofa Support Board Couch Cushion Support Insert Under Couch Seat Saver Replacement Fix Sagging C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pr3ga8uGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【What is the size of this Couch support?】Size of xooxfans Couch Cushions Support Board is 20\"x67\", thicker 50% than most of the support boards, which's 20\" width fits the depth of most three-seater sofas and provides nearly full coverage of regular-sized couch. 【Why do I need a SOFA SUPPORT?】Over time the frame of the couch or the springs itself become worn out from a lot of use, they naturally will begin to sag, but our cushion savers can reduce this uncomfortable furniture sagging problem. Furniture can have a second life with the help of our under seat cushion support. It helps to make a couch straight again and regain its oomph. 【What is the material of this cushion support?】Couch support insert board is covered with navy blue 600D oxford material, Its surface anti-slip texture can effectively prevent it from moving or sliding during use. The inner village is a layer of waterproof PVC membrane, which can effectively prevent the insert board from getting wet. Inside the oxford covering, it wraps high-density and thick 0.4” MDF board that can support the weight of people sitting on the seats without sagging. 【Why are our 0.4\" MDF wood boards heavier?】The density of our board is 0.72g/cm3, which meets the P2 level of the US safety level environmental protection standard, Possess SGS certificate. The formaldehyde content of the board below this density will exceed the standard. The boards adopt the chamfering process, which will minimize the burr of the wood, and the rounded corner design instead of sharp corners can effectively protect your furniture from being cut. 【What other uses does it have?】A sagging sofa will cause people to sit on the sofa in an incorrect sitting position, which will lead to lumbar pain and soreness over time. Our thick couch suppot is sturdy and rigid, It can improve the sunken state of the sofa, correct your sitting posture correctly, and avoid the physical discomfort that you feel when the lumbar spine is bent for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pr3ga8uGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"xooxfans","source_asin":"B0C48NWMBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C48NWMBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C48NWMBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
