window.products.push({"id":762319,"name":"Full Mattress, Avenco Full Size Mattress in a Box, 11 Inch Full Size Memory Foam Mattress, Cooling Gel Foam, Medium Firm, Ultimate Supportive, CertiPU","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-u4VFqbVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED BASED ON ERGONOMICS: This full memory foam mattress has 4 layers of CertiPUR-US foam for a comfortable and healthy sleeping environment. 3 inches Gel Memory Foam for cooling, 2 inches Comfort Foam for pressure relief, and double 3 inches Airflow High-density Foam Base for supportive. Please allow it 24-72 hours to expand. Sizes are subject to ±0.5 Inches. MEDIUM FIRMNESS MATTRESS AND BREATHABLE MATTRESS COVER: 4 layers of memory foam perfectly create a plush and comfortable sleeping feel for more restful sleeping. This full size mattress's cover is breathable and skin-friendly, providing increased comfort. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS SLEEPING POSITIONS: The unique design allows the medium firm full mattress to be shaped into the natural body shape of the sleepers while sleeping, thus achieving a balance between firmness and softness. With no-sink support foams, it can adapt and conform to your body for optimal pressure relief. Recommended for all style sleeping positions. ONE FULL MATTRESS TWO SLEEP EXPERIENCES: The full size memory foam mattress's cover comes with a zipper. The outer white mattress cover offers a plush comfortable feel, while the inner gray mattress cover provides a smooth and cooling feeling. You can choose the one you like. And you can easily remove and wash the mattress cover for easy care. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: You are covered by Avenco 100 nights sleep trial and 10-year support, no worry about ordering a full size mattress online. Avenco full mattress is CertiPUR-US & ISPA. This luxurious full size mattress in a box is compressed for convenient delivery and setup. Note: It is not for the adjustable frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-u4VFqbVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avenco","source_asin":"B092ZM4GGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092ZM4GGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092ZM4GGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
