window.products.push({"id":762473,"name":"Pretty Jolly Rainbow Large Dream Catcher Wall Decor Colorful Native Dreamcatcher Handmade Woven Feather Dream Catchers Wall Hanging for Bedroom,Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Au5shGVXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Dream catcher decor is a traditional culture of Native Americans.They believe that a dreamcatcher capture dreams and bring blessings.The bad dreams are trapped in the net,and then good dreams slide down the feathers and beads to the sleeping person.As the first rays of the morning light hit the dream catcher, the bad dreams disappear. Now most people buy it as a gift to give their lovers or friends,send their sincere heart and blessings. Product Description Material:Colored feathers,wood beads,thread. Package details:Opp bag package Includes: 1×Rainbow Dream catcher Size: Length:70cm/27.6 inch Big Circle Ring DIA:20cm/7.9inch Middle Circle Ring DIA:11cm/4.3 inch Three Small Circle Ring DIA:5cm/1.97 inch Weight:About 240g(include package) Tips: Can't ensure that every dream catcher is exactly the same,Slight size deviation is normal. Must to Know Care Instruction: The flowers in the middle of the dream catcher ring is random color! Usually, cleaning is not needed. If necessary, hand wash is the choice. Use a hair dryer to blow away the floating dust on the dream catchers carefully, Not to use hot air or blow it over a long distance!!! Then soak in clean water,shake gently to wash away the dust.Put the feathers on a dry towel,fold the towel in half to absorb moisture,and then dry it with a hair dryer. ⚠Attention: Do Not Machine Wash!!! Do Not Rub it!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Au5shGVXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pretty Jolly","source_asin":"B0BZ49VR1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ49VR1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ49VR1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
