window.products.push({"id":762750,"name":"MCJ Vacuum Sealer Machine, Automatic Food Sealer with Adjustable Size Roller,Double-layer Powerful Sealing for Food preservation，Dry/Moist /Manual Mod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7jq2VK3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why should you choose a vacuum sealer? 1:Vacuum sealing machine can reduce the contact between food and air, thereby maintaining the freshness of food. To keep food fresh for a long time, Our vacuum sealer machine upgraded double heating wire,double-layer sealing to seal the vacuum bag tightly, and keep fresh longer. 2:Sealed bag packaging can also leave more space in the refrigerator, allowing you to better manage the refrigerator to protect food from damage. You can use fresh food or ingredients to prepare cooking and prepare meals. Save your time and money! 3:It can protect the integrity of food. Unlike other vacuum machines on the market, our V63vacuum sealer can control the vacuum intensity at will, so as to protect soft foods from being deformed. Packing Details: 1x Sealer Machine 1xVacuum tube 1xpower cord 1xUser manual 10xvacuum bag ( 9.8inch x 11.8inch) Common Troubleshooting The vacuum sealer not operating: 1. Check whether there is a power outage or whether the machine is properly plugged in. 2. Check the power cord, the plug, and the machine to see if there is any damage, and if there is, do not use it. 3. When vacuuming, Make sure that the detachable drip tank is in the vacuum machine (do not take it out), and check that the vacuum bag mouth is placed in the detachable drip tank,otherwise the machine cannot vacuum lnsufficient air suction or failure of automatic heat sealing: 1.Whether open the lid without waiting for the green light off. 2. Check whether the lid is fully locked. 3. Check whether the bag is damaged and causes air leakage; whether the bag is correctly placed in the vacuum chamber; whether there are obstructions on the sealing sponge or the upper and lower welding bar. Make sure that the sealing sponge and welding bar are not deformed or damaged.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7jq2VK3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCJ","source_asin":"B099MQ744D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099MQ744D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099MQ744D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
