window.products.push({"id":762789,"name":"Unikito U Shaped Computer Desk, Reversible Office Desk with LED Strip and Power Outlet, L Shaped Gaming Desks with Monitor Stand and Storage Shelf, 83","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rQ1fWBueL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【REVERSIBLE U SHAPED DESIGN OFFICE DESK】With reversible U shape design, the office desk can provide you a fully functional workplace for whatever project you are working on. It features three desktops with plenty of surface area. You can use one side as a work area, second side for gaming area and the other for writing area. This reversible computer desk can be used as a 106.3 inch right or left L shaped desk, 130 inch long desk and 82.7 inch U shaped desk to suit your different needs. 【POWER OUTLETS AND MONITOR STAND】The U shaped computer desk is built in 4 power outlets and 2 USB charging ports. It provides extra power support for your computer, printer, scanner, phone, tablet, gaming gear etc, which provides a great convenience to your life when you are working or playing games. The flexible monitor stand allows for more space and helps to reduce your neck strain with a better sitting posture by providing an ergonomic sight level. 【SMART RGB LED STRIP LIGHTS】The RGB led strip light can support smart app control and IR remote control. You can freely control the RGB led lights with 60000 colors and multiple dynamic modes to meet your aesthetic needs. The built in music sync function can change the lights color with the rhythm of the music to create special and terrific atmosphere for gaming or working. It also can turn on/off automatically with timing setting function for convenient daily use. 【EXQUISITE AND STYLISH GRID DESIGN】 With the combination of functional and unique grid design, the l shaped office desk not only includes practical performance of modern furniture, but also bring you a nice addition to any room. The under grid bookshelf also maximally utilizes your home office space and provide enough space for storing books, magazines, devices and hosts for keeping your things organized and convenience usage. 【STURDY AND SOLID CONSTRUCTION】The construction of U shaped office desk is extremely sturdy and durable. Durability is a key to the construction of the corner desk. It is made from very thick engineered wood with 1” thick surface.The solid metal legs offer extra strength and sturdy. Its sturdy construction has a excellent load-bearing capacity to support up to 600 lbs. 【MULTIPURPOSE AND EASY ASSEMBLE】 The reversible design means it can fits into almost any space and have desk space at both sides for productivity. This desk can sit in a corner, large home office or smaller work nooks as a computer desk, office desk, gaming desk, study desk, executive desk with ample desktop and large storage space. It also can add vitality and style to your workstation and make your room cozy and complete. It easy to put together if you follow instruction page by page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rQ1fWBueL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unikito","source_asin":"B0BV9KQJY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV9KQJY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV9KQJY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":762790,"name":"8\" (200mm) Impulse Manual Bag Sealer Heat Seal Closer + Free KIT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41a7PHhOGTL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Manual Impulse Sealer - the perfect solution for all your bag sealing needs. Whether you’re in a warehouse, office, school, or even at home, this versatile machine is designed to help you quickly and easily seal bags made of thermosealable materials. Constructed with heavy-duty materials, this sealer is built to last and can withstand heavy use, ensuring that you get the best value for your investment. Its impulse heat system is designed to instantly heat up and does not require preheating time, making it an efficient and reliable tool for all your bag sealing needs. With its adjustable time settings, you can achieve a perfect seal no matter the thickness or material of the bag. This feature allows you to customize the machine to suit your specific requirements and ensures that you can use it for a wide range of applications. Using the sealer is simple and straightforward, and no training is required. Just place your bag made of thermosealable materials over the heating element, lower and hold the upper jaw for a few seconds, and your bag is sealed! The compact design of the sealer makes it counter-friendly, which means it takes up minimal space and is just as efficient as other more complex bag closers. This machine is ideal for sealing bags of various sizes and can be used for a wide range of applications. Whether you’re sealing food bags, packaging products, or sealing documents, this sealer is the perfect tool to help you get the job done quickly and efficiently. In conclusion, the Manual Impulse Sealer is an excellent investment for anyone who needs to seal bags of thermosealable materials quickly and efficiently. Its heavy-duty construction, instant heat, adjustable time settings, and simple operation make it an ideal tool for a wide range of applications. Whether you’re in a warehouse, office, school, DIY or manufacturing, this machine is a must-have for all your bag sealing needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41a7PHhOGTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JORESTECH","source_asin":"B0091JDTZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0091JDTZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0091JDTZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
