window.products.push({"id":762879,"name":"Frienda 20 LED Pink Rose Flower String Lights Battery Operated Romantic Fairy Lights for Valentine's Day, Wedding, Birthday Indoor Outdoor Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wamgqVsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3D Flower shape string lights: This sweet decoration light in the charming 3D flower shape will beautifully decorate your tree, fence, front path or porch, creating a warm and sweet atmosphere. Can use for indoor or outdoor.  Romantic decoration for most occasions: Suitable for Valentines Day, birthday, wedding and other day you want to decorate. Pretty rose design will coordinate with romantic theme. If you want to create a warm and loving atmosphere for your home, that's it.  Convenient and practical: If you turn on the rose flower string lights at 6 pm (under the 6 hours timer mode), it will turn off at 12 pm and turn on again at 6 pm the next day. You can choose 2 control modes to change 8 styles flicker modes: use the remote control or press the control button on battery case (range of remote control is around 5 meters).  8 Lighting modes: The flower string lights have 8 modes, combination, in waves, sequential, slow glow, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, steady on. Different modes can be applied in different situations to create different atmospheres.  Warning: Do not soak battery box in water. For safety reasons, please use alkaline batteries or rechargeable batteries. Otherwise, low quality batteries may destroy the electronic panel and affect the length of use time. Dot not mix batteries, which can reduce battery life and may cause leakage. Our string lights are waterproof, but to keep the flower beautiful all the time we recommend indoor use as far as possible.  Package includes: 1 x 20 LEDs flower string lights 1 x Batteries box (battery not included) 1 x Remote control (pulling out the plastic before using) 1 x User manual  Note: Choking risk may exist, please keep away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wamgqVsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frienda","source_asin":"B082WDG52Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-762879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082WDG52Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082WDG52Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
